<title>JAPAN: Aeon Credit to list on Tokyo stock exchange Dec 2.</title>
<headline>Aeon Credit to list on Tokyo stock exchange Dec 2.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aeon Credit Service Co Ltd said on Thursday that it would list its shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange's second section on December 2.  </p>
<p>Aeon Credit is a finance company in the group of supermarket operator Jusco Co Ltd, operating cash dispensers and automated teller machines under tie-ups with banks.</p>
<p>The company will issue one million new shares through a public offering. The payment date is December 1.</p>
